    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PRESENTATION</h2><br>Dekar is a noble warrior, heir to the throne, who has a estranged relationship with his father while nourishing a great love for his late mother. After abandoning his rights to the throne and choosing to live a simple life, one day everything changes for him, when a Winged One, crashes into his village asking for his help. The fate of the world now lies on his shoulders.<br><br>Memento Vivere is a classic 2D RPG in the style of Valiant Resurrection and Skyfall.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic Good versus Evil Storyline!<br></li><li>Beatifully composed Soundtrack!<br></li><li>Sidequests to complete!<br></li><li>Special weapons to find!<br></li><li>Difficulty Modes to choose from!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MORE GAMES</h2><br><br><br><br><br>",
